endpoints.responseShape:
{
  "signed": <int>,   // COUNT of prescriptions where physicianId = me AND status IN ('CONFIRMED','SIGNED')
  "sent":   <int>,   // COUNT where physicianId = me AND status = 'SENT'
  "total":  <int>    // COUNT where physicianId = me (ALL statuses, incl. DRAFT and DISPENSED)
}
Exactly three keys, in that order. Always integers, never null.
